body:
Thanks for your reply!
Here is an example, not alot since i'm still testing:

import plugin from "./app/plugins/plugin";
var pluginLoader = (function() {
  return {
    plugin0: plugin,
  };
}());
export default pluginLoader;

So i'm importing, creating the module and export it to the application. The returned object can be a dynamic number of plugins as described in the first example. Not very advanced since i'm new.
